---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Publishers | CCG Eleventy Prototype
description: Browse Cheeky Commodore Gamer titles by publisher in the lightweight Eleventy prototype.
permalink: /games/publishers/index.html
---
<section class="hero hero--compact">
  <p class="eyebrow">ARCHIVE PROTOTYPE</p>
  <h1>Publishers</h1>
  <p class="lede">Browse the normalized CCG game archive by publisher. These routes are generated at build time from the existing game data.</p>
</section>

<section class="archive-browser" aria-labelledby="publisher-list-heading">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <h2 id="publisher-list-heading">Browse publishers</h2>
    <p>{{ publisherArchive.count }} publisher routes generated from the canonical archive.</p>
  </div>

  <nav class="archive-jumps" aria-label="Browse game publishers">
    {% for publisher in publisherArchive.items %}
      <a href="/games/publishers/{{ publisher.slug }}/">{{ publisher.name }} <span aria-hidden="true">({{ publisher.games | length }})</span></a>
    {% endfor %}
  </nav>
</section>
